            <ArticleTitle>Bioactive constituents from the whole plants of Leontopodium leontopodioides (Wild.) Beauv.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1007/s11418-017-1132-3</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Five new compounds, leontoaerialosides A (1), B (2), C (3), D (4), and E (5) were obtained from the 70% EtOH extract of the whole plants of Leontopodium leontopodioides (Wild.) Beauv. Their structures were elucidated by chemical and spectroscopic methods. Moreover, compounds 4 and 5 showed significant effects on stimulating the hepatic glucose uptake in HepG2 cells.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
